<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 14.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 14.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- First Lady Leila Ben Ali chairs a charity exhibition.</p>
<p>- Citrus output expected to reach 150,000 tonnes in the Cap Bon region.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- About 40 percent of Tunisia's needs in pharmaceuticals are locally manufactured.</p>
